@{
}

<section class="bd-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <span class="bd-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-house-heart"></i> Agent gifting program</span>
                <h1 class="mt-3 mb-3">A closing gift they'll use before they unpack.</h1>
                <p class="lead mb-4">
                    Wine gets drunk. Gift cards get forgotten. Moving crates show up the exact week your
                    client needs them, with your name on the box. Subscribe monthly, gift in two clicks,
                    and we handle the rest.
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" asp-action="Plans">See plans &amp; pricing</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-lg" asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register"
                       asp-route-accountType="Realtor">Create an agent account</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="bd-hero-card p-4 p-md-5">
                    <p class="text-muted small text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing:.06em;">Your monthly rhythm</p>

                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="bd-step-number" style="margin-bottom:0;flex-shrink:0;">1</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">Credit lands on the 1st</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small">Your plan's gift credit is added automatically.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3 mb-3">
                        <div class="bd-step-number" style="margin-bottom:0;flex-shrink:0;">2</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">You close a deal</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small">Enter the client's name, email, and closing date.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-3">
                        <div class="bd-step-number" style="margin-bottom:0;flex-shrink:0;">3</div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">We take it from there</div>
                            <div class="text-muted small">Claim link, scheduling, delivery, pickup, and a co-branded insert.</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bd-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="bd-section-head">
            <h2>Why crates beat the usual closing gift</h2>
            <p>The gift is memorable because it arrives at the single most stressful moment of the transaction.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-4">
            <div class="col">
                <div class="bd-card">
                    <div class="bd-card-body">
                        <div class="bd-icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-calendar-week"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">A week of visibility</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Your co-branded insert sits in their kitchen for the entire rental, right when
                            they're telling friends about the move.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="bd-card">
                    <div class="bd-card-body">
                        <div class="bd-icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-wallet2"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Predictable spend</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            One monthly subscription instead of scrambling for a gift per closing.
                            Unused credit rolls over up to three months.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="bd-card">
                    <div class="bd-card-body">
                        <div class="bd-icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-hand-thumbs-up"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Zero admin for you</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Your client chooses their own dates and address through the claim link. You
                            never coordinate a delivery.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col">
                <div class="bd-card">
                    <div class="bd-card-body">
                        <div class="bd-icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i></div>
                        <h3 class="h6 fw-bold">Trackable</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            See which gifts were claimed, which are still outstanding, and what's left of
                            your credit, all from your dashboard.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bd-section bd-section-alt">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-3">What actually happens after you hit send</h2>

                <div class="bd-check-row">
                    <i class="bi bi-1-circle-fill"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Your client gets an email from you</strong>
                        <div class="text-muted small">
                            Branded with your name, your brokerage, and your personal message.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bd-check-row">
                    <i class="bi bi-2-circle-fill"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>They claim on their own schedule</strong>
                        <div class="text-muted small">
                            They pick a bundle, a delivery date, and a time window. Your credit comes off
                            the total automatically.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bd-check-row">
                    <i class="bi bi-3-circle-fill"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>They can upgrade at their own cost</strong>
                        <div class="text-muted small">
                            If they want a bigger bundle than your gift covers, they just pay the difference.
                            Your credit is never overspent.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bd-check-row">
                    <i class="bi bi-4-circle-fill"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>You see it in your dashboard</strong>
                        <div class="text-muted small">
                            Claimed date, bundle chosen, delivery date. Nothing about their payment details.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="bd-divider-note mt-4">
                    <p class="fw-semibold mb-1"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise me-1"></i>Changed your mind?</p>
                    <p class="small text-muted mb-0">
                        Cancel any gift that hasn't been claimed yet and the credit goes straight back to
                        your balance.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <div class="bd-card">
                    <div class="bd-card-body p-4 p-md-5">
                        <p class="text-muted small text-uppercase fw-bold mb-3" style="letter-spacing:.06em;">Gift email preview</p>
                        <div class="border rounded-3 p-4 mb-3" style="background:var(--bd-teal-50);">
                            <p class="fw-semibold mb-2">Congratulations on your new home, Priya!</p>
                            <p class="small text-muted mb-3">
                                Moving is the worst part of buying a house, so I've covered
                                <strong>$175</strong> toward reusable moving crates delivered right to your
                                door. Pick your dates and they'll handle the rest. &mdash; Alex Rivera,
                                Desert Sky Realty
                            </p>
                            <span class="btn btn-primary btn-sm disabled">Claim your crates</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted small mb-0">
                            Sent from your account, with your name and message. We just handle the logistics.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bd-section-tight" style="background:var(--bd-teal);">
    <div class="container text-center text-white py-3">
        <h2 class="text-white mb-3">Start gifting this month</h2>
        <p class="mb-4 opacity-75">Plans from $59/month. Cancel any time, and keep the credit you've already earned.</p>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-center flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold" asp-action="Plans">See plans &amp; pricing</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Talk to us first</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
